sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Attacker as Attacker Simulation
    participant Target as Fedora Endpoint / Target App
    participant Kernel as Linux Kernel / Network Interface
    participant Sensor as Wazuh Agent / Suricata IDS
    participant SIEM as Wazuh Manager & Indexer
    actor Analyst as SOC Analyst (Shiva Sathvik)

    Attacker->>Target: 1. Execute attack technique (e.g., SSH brute force, FIM tampering)
    Target->>Kernel: 2. Kernel captures syscalls & network sockets
    Kernel->>Sensor: 3. auditd, /var/log/secure & packet capture trigger
    Sensor->>Sensor: 4. Local parsing & hash comparison (FIM / Suricata rules)
    Sensor->>SIEM: 5. Forward structured telemetry / alerts (TLS Port 1514)
    SIEM->>SIEM: 6. Decoder extraction, rule evaluation & correlation
    SIEM->>SIEM: 7. Alert indexation & MITRE ATT&CK mapping
    Analyst->>SIEM: 8. Triage dashboard alert & review event timeline
    Analyst->>Target: 9. Execute Python automation (log_analyzer.py, integrity_monitor.py)
    Analyst->>Analyst: 10. Generate Incident Response Report & apply remediation
